COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.address."addressRegion" IS 'The region in which the locality is, and which is in the country. For example, California or another appropriate first-level Administrative division. [https://schema.org/addressRegion]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.address."addressType" IS 'A person or organization can have different addresses, for different purposes. For example, a postal address, a loan address, an address for visits and so on. This property is used to specify the kind of address. [http://rs.tdwg.org/ltc/terms/addressType]';
