COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.chronometric_age."chronometricAgeProtocol" IS 'A description of or reference to the methods used to determine the chronometric age. [http://rs.tdwg.org/chrono/terms/chronometricAgeProtocol]';
