COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geographic_context."waterBody" IS 'The name of the water body in which the Location occurs. [http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/waterBody]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geographic_context."waterBodyType" IS 'A term that indicates the aquatic order of a waterbody. [http://rs.tdwg.org/ltc/terms/waterBodyType]';

