COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geological_context."group" IS 'The full name of the lithostratigraphic group from which the cataloged item was collected. [http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/group]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geological_context."latestAgeOrHighestStage" IS 'The full name of the latest possible geochronologic age or highest chronostratigraphic stage attributable to the stratigraphic horizon from which the cataloged item was collected. [http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/latestAgeOrHighestStage]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geological_context."latestEonOrHighestEonothem" IS 'The full name of the latest possible geochronologic eon or highest chrono-stratigraphic eonothem or the informal name (Precambrian) attributable to the stratigraphic horizon from which the cataloged item was collected. [http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/latestEonOrHighestEonothem]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geological_context."latestEpochOrHighestSeries" IS 'The full name of the latest possible geochronologic epoch or highest chronostratigraphic series attributable to the stratigraphic horizon from which the cataloged item was collected. [http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/latestEpochOrHighestSeries]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geological_context."latestEraOrHighestErathem" IS 'The full name of the latest possible geochronologic era or highest chronostratigraphic erathem attributable to the stratigraphic horizon from which the cataloged item was collected. [http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/latestEraOrHighestErathem]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geological_context."latestPeriodOrHighestSystem" IS 'The full name of the latest possible geochronologic period or highest chronostratigraphic system attributable to the stratigraphic horizon from which the cataloged item was collected. [http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/latestPeriodOrHighestSystem]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.geological_context."member" IS 'The full name of the lithostratigraphic member from which the cataloged item was collected. [http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/member]';
