COMMENT ON TABLE ltc_dp_collapsed.scheme_measurement_or_fact IS 'A type of measurement or fact used by the LatimerCoreScheme, and the rules relating to its application. [http://rs.tdwg.org/ltc/terms/SchemeMeasurementOrFact]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.scheme_measurement_or_fact."schemeMeasurementOrFact_pk" IS 'A unique identifier for an ltc:SchemeMeasurementOrFact. [http://example.com/term-pending/schemeMeasurementOrFactID]';
