COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.temporal_coverage."temporalCoverage_pk" IS 'A unique identifier for an ltc:TemporalCoverage. [http://example.com/term-pending/temporalCoverageID]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.temporal_coverage."collectionStatusHistory_fk" IS 'An identifier for an ltc:CollectionStatusHistory. [http://rs.tdwg.org/ltc/terms/hasTemporalCoverage]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.temporal_coverage."event_fk" IS 'An identifier for an ltc:Event. [http://rs.tdwg.org/ltc/terms/hasTemporalCoverage]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.temporal_coverage."personRole_fk" IS 'An identifier for an ltc:PersonRole. [http://rs.tdwg.org/ltc/terms/hasTemporalCoverage]';
