COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.temporal_coverage."temporalCoverageStartDateTime" IS 'Datetime at which the TemporalCoverage began. [http://rs.tdwg.org/ltc/terms/temporalCoverageStartDateTime]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ltc_dp_collapsed.temporal_coverage."temporalCoverageType" IS 'The type or context of the described TemporalCoverage. [http://rs.tdwg.org/ltc/terms/temporalCoverageType]';

